// MC30c frigate, measured from the STL file the user supplied
// (MC30CFrigate.STL; no author or licence came with it). Ship frame: x from
// the stern (0) to the bow (380 m), y up from the lowest point (the ventral
// sensor under the bow), z to starboard. The hull is fitted station by
// station: a thread inside the tail plane, the aft engine housing, the spine
// and the large rounded head. The anhedral tail plane, fins, vanes, engine
// pods, keel, dorsal ridge and turret blocks are ordinary structures
// measured from the model.
// The retired twelve laser windows and sixteen light-ion windows are replaced
